  "description": "Having retired from figure skating due to injury, Gyu-eon is now making a living as a chef. Suddenly, Eun-hyung—a junior skater who once left him with words that felt like a curse—reappears before him.\n\n*“It’s obvious you’ll never succeed at anything, hyung…”*\n\nAlthough he is wary of Eun-hyung, who left him with deep emotional scars, and tries to push him away, he soon finds himself increasingly drawn to him...\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Ice_on_me)",
